</td></table>
<table border=0 cellpadding=1 cellspacing=0 width=100%><td nowrap>
<font size=3 color=#606060><strong>▽</strong> 2003/04/15 (火) 18:20:49 <strong>▽</strong> <a href="mailto:kou&#95;sa&#95;to@yahoo.co.jp">kou@運営委員</a> </font></td>
<td nowrap align=left><font size=3>　<a href="index.cgi?res=200304152182049&log=data1">返信</a>　削除<input type=checkbox name="target" value="200304152182049"></font>
</td></table>
<table border=0 cellpadding=16 cellspacing=0 width=100%><td>
